---
import GuideLayout from '../layouts/GuideLayout.astro';
import { LINKS } from '../site.config';
---

<GuideLayout
  title="STATIC Codes (October 2026) — Roblox"
  description="Every working STATIC code on Roblox, checked by the developers. No codes are live in the October 2026 beta yet; launch codes will be listed here first."
  path="/codes/"
  h1="STATIC codes"
  kicker="Official · Checked by the developers"
  crumb="Codes"
  updated="2026-10-08"
>
  <p class="text-lg">
    This is the official list of codes for STATIC on Roblox, kept by the developers, so it's the
    first list to change when a code goes live or expires.
  </p>

  <h2 id="active">Active codes</h2>
  <div class="callout">
    <strong>No codes are live yet.</strong> STATIC is in its first beta. Codes are planned, and the
    first ones will go up here and in the Discord at the same moment.
  </div>

  <h2 id="expired">Expired codes</h2>
  <p>None yet.</p>

  <h2 id="where">Where new codes come from</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Announcements in the <a href={LINKS.discord} rel="noopener" target="_blank">STATIC Discord</a>, usually first.</li>
    <li>Update posts in the <a href={LINKS.roblox} rel="noopener" target="_blank">Beanie's Studios Roblox group</a>.</li>
    <li>Descriptions of new videos on the <a href={LINKS.youtube} rel="noopener" target="_blank">YouTube channel</a>.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Codes you see on other sites that aren't listed here aren't real. If a site asks for your
    Roblox password to "unlock" a code, it's a scam.
  </p>
</GuideLayout>
